    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll start explaining the operation. First of all...",
      "translation" : "我来说明行动内容。首先..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll start explaining the operation. First of all...",
      "translation" : "我来说明行动内容。首先..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...... now you can run wild.",
      "translation" : "...现在你们可以放开手脚行动了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Something seems to have exploded over there. The flames have risen from the front!",
      "translation" : "那边好像发生了爆炸。前方燃起了火焰！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are 4 identified locations these explosion came from! I have ^FF0000shown them on your minimap.^000000",
      "translation" : "已经确认有4个爆炸地点！我已在你的小地图上^FF0000标出位置。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's quite sudden but, I'm changing the operation.",
      "translation" : "虽然有些突然，但我要改变行动计划。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't worry about those already at the front, they adjust to any situation.",
      "translation" : "不用担心已经在前线的人，他们能应对各种情况。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Divide into 4 teams, everyone at their own locations and start suppressing the leads. If any team finds Elyumina, let us know immediately.",
      "translation" : "分成4支小队，分别前往各自地点，开始搜查线索。如果有小队发现艾露米娜，立刻通知我们。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Everyone, to your position! Start the operation!",
      "translation" : "所有人各就各位！开始行动！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I ask you to act separately adventurer. Please check your ^0000CDminimap^000000 to organize the situation as quickly as possible. Join the team if they need support!",
      "translation" : "冒险者，请你单独行动。查看^0000CD小地图^000000，尽快掌握情况。需要支援时加入小队！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The briefing... the criminal here will be the one to do it.",
      "translation" : "简报...就让这里的犯人来说明吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's hard to babysit criminals.",
      "translation" : "照看犯人真麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha! Isn't that your job? Do it properly. Why are you leaving the briefing to me?",
      "translation" : "哈哈！这不是你的工作吗？好好做啊。为什么把简报交给我？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So noisy. Before we get started. Are you part of the USU now?",
      "translation" : "真吵。开始之前，你现在是USU的一员了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That, that's what he said... are you afraid that I'll be scared!",
      "translation" : "他、他就是这么说的...你是怕我会害怕吗！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Heh, I'll do the explaining because I want to take care of my children!",
      "translation" : "哼，我来说明，因为我要照顾我的孩子们！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... Okay, it's almost time.",
      "translation" : "...好吧，差不多到时间了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My children will start setting up traps in <TIPBOX>[four places]<INFO>8086</INFO></TIPBOX>.",
      "translation" : "我的孩子们会开始在<TIPBOX>[四处地点]<INFO>8086</INFO></TIPBOX>布置陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Here, take the map. The information will also be delivered to the party members as well.",
      "translation" : "给，拿着地图。相关信息也会发送给队伍成员。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You aren't alone right? You know my children are powerful?",
      "translation" : "你不是一个人来的吧？你知道我的孩子们有多厉害吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go ahead and touch the traps. The traps will activate and my lovely children will appear.",
      "translation" : "去触发那些陷阱吧。陷阱启动后，我可爱的孩子们就会出现。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You do remember how the traps work, right?",
      "translation" : "你还记得陷阱怎么运作吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After you've cleared the four traps, EL1_A17T will come out, and this lady here will bring you to the same place as last time.",
      "translation" : "清除四个陷阱后，EL1_A17T就会出现，这位女士会把你带到上次去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That's it for the explanation. Now, get to work! Muscle idiots! Ahahaha!",
      "translation" : "说明到此为止。现在开工吧！一群肌肉笨蛋！啊哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃尔科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...I'll have a conversation with this criminal in a bit... Anyways. I'm counting on you, adventurers!",
      "translation" : "...我待会儿要和这个犯人谈谈...总之，冒险者们，拜托你们了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That was fast... It was expected that my kids wouldn't win though.",
      "translation" : "真快...不过我早就料到我的孩子们会输。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's a lot more trouble going on up there~",
      "translation" : "上面还有更麻烦的事情呢~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... are you going straight for my EL1-A17T?",
      "translation" : "...你要直接去找我的EL1-A17T吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go in.",
      "translation" : "进去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't go in yet.",
      "translation" : "暂时别进去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Come on, I was about to open it.",
      "translation" : "来嘛，我正准备打开呢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hahaha! Yes. Let's work hard. Gather more battle data for me!",
      "translation" : "哈哈哈！没错。好好努力，为我收集更多战斗数据！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a suspicious box! A signal is being transmitted from the inside, it's currently being decrypted!",
      "translation" : "发现了一个可疑的箱子！里面正在发出信号，目前正在解码！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Destroy the Biological Battery and kill the monsters!",
      "translation" : "摧毁生物电池，消灭怪物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sorry for the late analysis. It wasn't a device to summon monsters.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，分析得有些晚了。那不是召唤怪物的装置。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After summoning the monsters, it summons a bio-battery to strengthen the monsters and explodes.",
      "translation" : "召唤怪物后，它还会召出一枚生物电池来强化怪物，随后发生爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you want to handle it, just destroy it. It's good because it's a simple solution.",
      "translation" : "想解决它的话，直接摧毁就行。简单有效。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, it looks like this is over....",
      "translation" : "好了，看起来这边已经结束了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It looks like you've found something interesting here. You should check out the other teams!",
      "translation" : "看来你在这里发现了有趣的东西。去看看其他小队吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The cause of the explosion is unknown, but I've found this suspicious box at the site. It seems to be some type of mechanism.",
      "translation" : "爆炸原因不明，不过我在现场发现了这个可疑箱子。它似乎是某种装置。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a signal being transmitted from the inside... Huh, be careful. Something's happening!",
      "translation" : "里面有信号正在传出...咦，小心！有情况！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Destroy the Biological Battery and kill the monsters!",
      "translation" : "摧毁生物电池，消灭怪物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 461,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 462,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a suspicious box! A signal is being transmitted from the inside, it's currently being decrypted!",
      "translation" : "发现了一个可疑的箱子！里面正在发出信号，目前正在解码！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 467,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 468,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Avoid the Chemical Poison and kill the monsters!",
      "translation" : "避开化学毒素，消灭怪物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 473,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 474,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's an awful but interesting device. It wasn't a device meant to summon monsters.",
      "translation" : "这装置又糟糕又有趣。它并不是用来召唤怪物的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 476,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 477,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After summoning monsters, it constantly releases chemical poison, making it even more difficult to remove the monster.",
      "translation" : "召唤怪物后，它会不断释放化学毒素，让清除怪物变得更加困难。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 479,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
